<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">kimi janai nara</font></b></font></font></font>

33
00:01:11,380 --> 00:01:12,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">if you're not the one</font></b></font></font></font>

34
00:01:12,890 --> 00:01:13,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">imi wa nai no sa</font></b></font></font></font>

35
00:01:12,890 --> 00:01:13,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">there will be no meaning</font></b></font></font></font>

36
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">dakara haruka kanata</font></b></font></font></font>

37
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">and so we'll go far off into the distance</font></b></font></font></font>

38
00:01:30,860 --> 00:01:33,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey you, failure.</font>

39
00:01:35,450 --> 00:01:37,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have two pieces
of advice for you.</font>

40
00:01:38,530 --> 00:01:40,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, if you intend to call
yourself a Shinobi,</font>

41
00:01:40,450 --> 00:01:41,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">stop that revolting cheering of yours.</font>

42
00:01:43,410 --> 00:01:44,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And second...</font>

43
00:01:45,870 --> 00:01:48,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a failure will
always be a failure.</font>

44
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:50,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no changing that!</font>

45
00:01:53,880 --> 00:01:55,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you want to see about that?</font>

46
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:04,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

47
00:02:04,890 --> 00:02:07,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun, I get where you're
coming from, believe me.</font>

48
00:02:08,440 --> 00:02:11,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But all fighting must be done
officially in a match!</font>

49
00:02:13,110 --> 00:02:16,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The failure beats the gifted genius
through sheer effort...</font>

50
00:02:17,700 --> 00:02:19,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wouldn't that make for
an exciting main battle?</font>

51
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I promise you.</font>

52
00:02:34,050 --> 00:02:35,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will win no matter what!</font>

53
00:02:45,060 --> 00:02:51,020
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Gaara Crushed!!</font>

54
00:02:45,060 --> 00:02:51,020
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Youth!</font>

55
00:02:45,060 --> 00:02:51,020
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Power!</font>

56
00:02:45,060 --> 00:02:51,020
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Explosion!</font>

57
00:02:51,900 --> 00:02:52,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Choji!</font>

58
00:02:53,310 --> 00:02:54,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're in trouble.</font>

59
00:02:54,980 --> 00:02:57,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only the strong ones are left.</font>

60
00:02:58,360 --> 00:03:01,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Probably the strongest of Hidden Sound
must be that bloke.</font>

61
00:03:02,820 --> 00:03:05,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And Lee is apparently strong
enough to take on Sasuke!</font>

62
00:03:06,790 --> 00:03:08,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And particularly that Sand guy!</font>

63
00:03:09,620 --> 00:03:12,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's probably
the most dangerous one!</font>

64
00:03:18,550 --> 00:03:20,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I don't care!</font>

65
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:23,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I plan to forfeit right away
if that happens...</font>

66
00:03:23,390 --> 00:03:24,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— So that means...
— Huh?</font>

67
00:03:25,100 --> 00:03:27,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...you plan to forego
all-you-can-eat BBQ, too, then.</font>

68
00:03:27,890 --> 00:03:30,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Come on!</font>

69
00:03:31,770 --> 00:03:32,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry.</font>

70
00:03:32,980 --> 00:03:34,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If things start getting ugly,</font>

71
00:03:34,230 --> 00:03:38,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll step in and stop the fight,
like I did for Hinata. Okay?</font>

72
00:03:38,610 --> 00:03:40,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Prime beef tongue, short ribs...</font>

73
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:42,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— You can eat what you want.
— Don't dangle food in front of him!</font>

74
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:44,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Besides he didn't step in...
— You can eat whatever you want...</font>

75
00:03:44,820 --> 00:03:46,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— and stop the fight for Hinata.
— and all you want.</font>

76
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:56,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-B-Q! All right, B-B-Q!
All you can eat!</font>

77
00:04:00,260 --> 00:04:02,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He doesn't look good.</font>

78
00:04:03,220 --> 00:04:04,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Watching the previous fight...</font>

79
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:06,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did it get stirred up?</font>

80
00:04:08,220 --> 00:04:10,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His inner demon!</font>

81
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:14,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm curious about that guy, Neji, too...</font>

82
00:04:17,520 --> 00:04:19,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here's a plan.</font>

83
00:04:21,190 --> 00:04:21,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kankuro?</font>

84
00:04:21,990 --> 00:04:24,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just a little
information-gathering mission.</font>

85
00:04:26,450 --> 00:04:27,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hey!
— Huh?</font>

86
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:30,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing here
all by yourself?</font>

87
00:04:30,620 --> 00:04:32,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shouldn't you be with your friends?</font>

88
00:04:33,410 --> 00:04:35,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-It's none of your business, is it?!</font>

89
00:04:37,630 --> 00:04:39,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmmm. Well, well...</font>

90
00:04:40,590 --> 00:04:42,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy... Hyuga Neji, right?</font>

91
00:04:43,630 --> 00:04:45,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, it seems to me that</font>

92
00:04:45,340 --> 00:04:47,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he didn't reveal the true extent
of his power in that last match.</font>

93
00:04:48,180 --> 00:04:49,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's he about?</font>

94
00:04:51,390 --> 00:04:53,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to crush him!</font>

95
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:58,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Err, that's not what
I was asking.</font>

96
00:04:59,320 --> 00:05:02,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides, this guy's way out of his league...</font>

97
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:06,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You seem like a fun guy.
I quite like you.</font>

98
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:11,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're dull.
And I don't like you at all!</font>

99
00:05:13,450 --> 00:05:16,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to waste this guy!</font>

100
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:21,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We will now resume the battle.</font>

101
00:05:25,170 --> 00:05:26,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

102
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:30,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll be up this time for sure.
Go for it, Lee!</font>

103
00:05:31,220 --> 00:05:31,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

104
00:05:31,990 --> 00:05:32,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Huh?
— What?</font>

105
00:05:33,470 --> 00:05:38,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seeing as I've come this far,
I'd rather be the last!</font>

106
00:05:40,570 --> 00:05:42,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is Lee-san sulking?</font>

107
00:06:09,140 --> 00:06:11,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and get down here...</font>

108
00:06:14,850 --> 00:06:16,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Safe!</font>

109
00:06:17,810 --> 00:06:20,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hey!
— Don't do anything misleading, idiot!</font>

110
00:06:20,820 --> 00:06:21,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font size="110"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Gaara</font></font></font></b></font>

111
00:06:20,820 --> 00:06:21,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font size="110"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Rock Lee</font></font></font></b></font>

112
00:06:21,280 --> 00:06:21,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font size="110"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Gaara</font></font></font></b></font>

113
00:06:21,280 --> 00:06:21,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font size="110"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Rock Lee</font></font></font></b></font>

114
00:06:21,740 --> 00:06:23,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font size="110"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Gaara</font></font></font></b></font>

115
00:06:21,740 --> 00:06:23,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font size="110"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Rock Lee</font></font></font></b></font>

116
00:06:24,150 --> 00:06:24,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Lee-san!</font>

117
00:06:26,650 --> 00:06:28,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It worked!</font>

118
00:06:28,860 --> 00:06:31,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you say you want to go last,
then you won't be last.</font>

119
00:06:31,820 --> 00:06:33,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's an application of the same law</font>

120
00:06:33,870 --> 00:06:36,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that says a stone thrown to hit
a telephone pole will miss,</font>

121
00:06:36,540 --> 00:06:39,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and a stone thrown to miss
will be a direct hit!</font>

122
00:06:39,710 --> 00:06:42,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right! That's my student!</font>

123
00:06:42,840 --> 00:06:45,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I absolutely did not
want to go last!</font>

124
00:06:45,760 --> 00:06:48,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I threw them a beauty of a curve!</font>

125
00:06:48,970 --> 00:06:50,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Threw whom a curve?</font>

126
00:06:51,010 --> 00:06:54,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, so let me give you
a little piece of "nice" advice.</font>

127
00:06:54,930 --> 00:06:55,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

128
00:06:56,930 --> 00:07:00,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Probably no one has noticed yet, but...</font>

129
00:07:00,980 --> 00:07:03,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That gourd is suspicious!</font>

130
00:07:04,110 --> 00:07:05,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see!</font>

131
00:07:05,780 --> 00:07:06,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Quit with the notes!</font>

132
00:07:07,110 --> 00:07:11,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not going to have time to
read them during the match! Fool!</font>

133
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:12,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see!</font>

134
00:07:13,870 --> 00:07:15,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He didn't realize that?</font>

135
00:07:16,660 --> 00:07:18,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow, is Lee-san going to be all right?</font>

136
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:23,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!
Go! Lee!</font>

137
00:07:23,830 --> 00:07:25,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

138
00:07:34,010 --> 00:07:37,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am very happy to be squaring
off with you so early in the match.</font>

139
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:46,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know what kind of moves
that bowl-cut guy has,</font>

140
00:07:46,400 --> 00:07:48,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but he will never take Gaara.</font>

141
00:07:49,070 --> 00:07:50,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Never!</font>

142
00:07:50,860 --> 00:07:55,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's fast, to be sure,
but his kick is not all that great.</font>

143
00:07:56,330 --> 00:07:57,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...</font>

144
00:08:08,750 --> 00:08:11,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's... strong!</font>

145
00:08:16,260 --> 00:08:17,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please don't be in such a hurry.</font>

146
00:08:24,190 --> 00:08:24,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee-san...</font>

147
00:08:28,400 --> 00:08:30,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be careful, Lee.</font>

148
00:08:35,910 --> 00:08:38,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then... the 9th match...</font>

149
00:08:41,660 --> 00:08:42,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Begin!</font>

150
00:08:46,630 --> 00:08:48,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf Hurricane!</font>

151
00:09:06,230 --> 00:09:07,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that...?</font>

152
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:08,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sand?</font>

153
00:09:08,900 --> 00:09:10,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What an unusual Jutsu...</font>

154
00:09:10,730 --> 00:09:13,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's sand in his gourd!</font>

155
00:09:14,570 --> 00:09:15,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's...</font>

156
00:09:19,870 --> 00:09:21,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it?</font>

157
00:09:22,620 --> 00:09:24,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Desert Coffin!</font>

158
00:09:34,300 --> 00:09:35,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Desert Burial!</font>

159
00:09:39,140 --> 00:09:41,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not another horror story like that...</font>

160
00:09:42,810 --> 00:09:44,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A sand-manipulating Jutsu, eh?</font>

161
00:09:45,560 --> 00:09:46,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sounds like trouble.</font>

162
00:09:47,650 --> 00:09:49,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But let's give it a go!</font>

163
00:10:17,550 --> 00:10:20,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even that Lee-san's fast strikes...</font>

164
00:10:20,220 --> 00:10:21,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">have no effect at all!</font>

165
00:10:22,010 --> 00:10:24,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the deal?!</font>

166
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:28,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No physical strike is going to
have any effect on him.</font>

167
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:29,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

168
00:10:29,270 --> 00:10:31,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Sand shields and protects Gaara</font>

169
00:10:31,650 --> 00:10:34,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">on its own accord, independently
of any intent on Gaara's part.</font>

170
00:10:35,780 --> 00:10:39,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why... no one has been able
to do it so far...</font>

171
00:10:40,950 --> 00:10:44,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Injure Gaara, that is.</font>

172
00:10:47,660 --> 00:10:51,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crap! He's not moving
a muscle and still...!</font>

173
00:10:52,670 --> 00:10:53,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that it?</font>

174
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:58,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Entertain me a bit more...</font>

175
00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:01,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's not enough yet!</font>

176
00:11:04,180 --> 00:11:04,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Blood!</font>

177
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:22,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is Lee-san only using Taijutsu?</font>

178
00:11:23,370 --> 00:11:25,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He'll never be able to get close
enough for that!</font>

179
00:11:26,040 --> 00:11:29,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why doesn't he step back a bit and
use Ninjutsu or something?</font>

180
00:11:30,500 --> 00:11:32,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not that he doesn't use it.</font>

181
00:11:32,880 --> 00:11:33,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He can't use it.</font>

182
00:11:34,590 --> 00:11:35,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

183
00:11:35,590 --> 00:11:39,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee has almost no Ninjutsu
or Genjutsu skills.</font>

184
00:11:40,170 --> 00:11:41,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-No way!</font>

185
00:11:42,720 --> 00:11:46,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I first met Lee,
he was completely inept.</font>

186
00:11:46,930 --> 00:11:48,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He had no talent whatsoever.</font>

187
00:11:49,640 --> 00:11:51,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? I can't believe that!</font>

188
00:12:20,010 --> 00:12:20,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey hey!</font>

189
00:12:31,770 --> 00:12:32,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Certainly...</font>

190
00:12:33,060 --> 00:12:37,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A ninja who can't do Ninjutsu
and Genjutsu is a rarity.</font>

191
00:12:38,770 --> 00:12:45,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why, the only path open to Lee
as a Ninja was Taijutsu.</font>

192
00:12:47,280 --> 00:12:50,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But! That's precisely what
makes him a winner!</font>

193
00:12:50,410 --> 00:12:51,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

194
00:12:51,580 --> 00:12:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee, take them off!</font>

195
00:12:54,460 --> 00:12:56,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-But Guy-sensei...!</font>

196
00:12:56,630 --> 00:12:59,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You told me only to do that</font>

197
00:12:59,130 --> 00:13:00,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to protect a large group
of very important people!</font>

198
00:13:01,050 --> 00:13:02,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's quite all right!</font>

199
00:13:02,670 --> 00:13:03,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I give you permission!</font>

200
00:13:13,680 --> 00:13:14,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are those...?</font>

201
00:13:15,100 --> 00:13:16,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Weights?</font>

202
00:13:16,940 --> 00:13:18,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's some cliché training...</font>

203
00:13:18,940 --> 00:13:20,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see!</font>

204
00:13:20,570 --> 00:13:21,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ridiculous!</font>

205
00:13:23,610 --> 00:13:26,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, now I can
move easily!</font>

206
00:13:27,570 --> 00:13:31,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph! Does he think
removing some measly little weights</font>

207
00:13:31,080 --> 00:13:33,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is going to enable him to
outmaneuver Gaara's sand...?</font>

208
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:41,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A bit extreme, I'd say, Guy.</font>

209
00:13:44,210 --> 00:13:46,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go, Lee!</font>

210
00:13:46,340 --> 00:13:47,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

211
00:14:02,610 --> 00:14:03,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go!</font>

212
00:14:04,650 --> 00:14:05,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Very close!</font>

213
00:14:05,900 --> 00:14:06,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fast!</font>

214
00:14:07,110 --> 00:14:07,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Amazing...!</font>

215
00:14:14,540 --> 00:14:17,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because he can't use
Ninjutsu or Genjutsu...</font>

216
00:14:18,120 --> 00:14:21,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Therefore, he channeled all
of his time,</font>

217
00:14:21,880 --> 00:14:24,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">all of his energy and...</font>

218
00:14:24,460 --> 00:14:26,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">all of his being into Taijutsu.</font>

219
00:14:28,590 --> 00:14:31,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Though he can't do any other Jutsu...</font>

220
00:14:32,100 --> 00:14:34,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He won't lose to anyone...</font>

221
00:14:34,770 --> 00:14:36,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is a Taijutsu specialist!</font>

222
00:14:50,110 --> 00:14:52,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't believe it!
Gaara's been injured!</font>

223
00:14:54,160 --> 00:14:55,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way...!</font>

224
00:14:55,830 --> 00:14:59,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bushy-Brows is even
faster than before!</font>

225
00:15:00,210 --> 00:15:02,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was he this strong?!</font>

226
00:15:03,250 --> 00:15:08,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Youth is... explosion!</font>

227
00:15:08,760 --> 00:15:10,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

228
00:15:18,560 --> 00:15:19,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over here!</font>

229
00:15:24,310 --> 00:15:24,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good!</font>

230
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:27,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got him good!</font>

231
00:15:28,570 --> 00:15:30,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A-Amazing, he's so fast!</font>

232
00:15:31,360 --> 00:15:33,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Sand Shield can't keep
up with him!</font>

233
00:15:34,200 --> 00:15:35,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A direct hit!</font>

234
00:15:35,620 --> 00:15:37,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A-Amazing.</font>

235
00:15:37,660 --> 00:15:39,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His strikes are lightning fast...!</font>

236
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:42,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't even track him
with my eyes!</font>

237
00:15:53,890 --> 00:15:54,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh oh...</font>

238
00:15:55,140 --> 00:15:56,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh oh is right!</font>

239
00:15:56,890 --> 00:16:00,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That black-circles-under-the-eye
guy is taking some serious blows!</font>

240
00:16:01,190 --> 00:16:02,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not what I meant.</font>

241
00:16:03,270 --> 00:16:03,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

242
00:16:21,040 --> 00:16:22,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What the...?!</font>

243
00:16:22,580 --> 00:16:25,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His face is crumbling right off...!</font>

244
00:16:25,830 --> 00:16:27,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His whole body is covered
with sand...</font>

245
00:16:27,960 --> 00:16:29,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's not a scratch on him!</font>

246
00:16:29,920 --> 00:16:31,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's with this guy?!</font>

247
00:16:36,760 --> 00:16:39,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure enough, he was
encased in sand, eh.</font>

248
00:16:40,140 --> 00:16:42,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, it's been a long time since</font>

249
00:16:42,520 --> 00:16:44,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've seen that expression
on Gaara's face.</font>

250
00:16:46,230 --> 00:16:49,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I felt that he was becoming
more and more unstable</font>

251
00:16:49,190 --> 00:16:51,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as the Chunin Exam progressed...</font>

252
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:57,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So Gaara's other self has
been awakened, eh?</font>

253
00:17:02,040 --> 00:17:04,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! What is that?</font>

254
00:17:04,670 --> 00:17:08,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That protected him
against Bushy-Brow's strikes?</font>

255
00:17:08,420 --> 00:17:11,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... It's Sand Armor.</font>

256
00:17:11,840 --> 00:17:12,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Armor?</font>

257
00:17:13,130 --> 00:17:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ordinarily, the Sand Shield
functions to protect him automatically,</font>

258
00:17:16,470 --> 00:17:19,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but, if by chance,
the Shield is penetrated,</font>

259
00:17:19,470 --> 00:17:21,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Sand Armor functions as a second
layer of protection against strikes...</font>

260
00:17:22,430 --> 00:17:25,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's Gaara's... absolute defense!</font>

261
00:17:25,850 --> 00:17:28,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then, there's no way
to get him!</font>

262
00:17:28,860 --> 00:17:30,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He doesn't have any weak points.</font>

263
00:17:31,360 --> 00:17:33,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No. That's not entirely true...</font>

264
00:17:34,740 --> 00:17:37,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Sand Armor is actually
riddled with weak points.</font>

265
00:17:38,870 --> 00:17:42,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First of all, because it's not automatic,
it uses up a lot of Chakra.</font>

266
00:17:42,660 --> 00:17:44,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's also less effective
than the Sand Shield,</font>

267
00:17:44,830 --> 00:17:47,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and it takes an enormous amount
of physical energy</font>

268
00:17:47,210 --> 00:17:49,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to keep the sand clinging
to the body like that.</font>

269
00:17:50,540 --> 00:17:56,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara's having to use the armor...
is proof that he's under pressure.</font>

270
00:17:57,220 --> 00:18:00,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Lee is really good...</font>

271
00:18:01,600 --> 00:18:03,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, the outcome of the match
is already a given.</font>

272
00:18:04,930 --> 00:18:07,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He will never beat Gaara!</font>

273
00:18:09,190 --> 00:18:10,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that all?</font>

274
00:18:11,940 --> 00:18:13,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But what an incredible
defense he has...</font>

275
00:18:14,190 --> 00:18:17,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">no amount of speed is going
to let me get a strike through.</font>

276
00:18:18,910 --> 00:18:23,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll have to do major damage
from above the sand guard.</font>

277
00:18:25,580 --> 00:18:26,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That will be Lotus!</font>

278
00:18:30,880 --> 00:18:31,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

279
00:18:45,770 --> 00:18:46,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be ready!</font>

280
00:18:52,440 --> 00:18:55,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A thin sand guard like that
will be inconsequential</font>

281
00:18:56,110 --> 00:18:59,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the face of Lee's high-speed
Lotus slamming down from above.</font>

282
00:19:01,370 --> 00:19:02,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and bring it on!</font>

283
00:19:03,370 --> 00:19:05,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You asked for it!</font>

284
00:19:08,790 --> 00:19:09,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He didn't float.</font>

285
00:19:10,120 --> 00:19:11,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not just yet!</font>

286
00:19:19,050 --> 00:19:20,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What an amazing series of kicks!</font>

287
00:19:23,510 --> 00:19:27,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even an ordinary Lotus has
a tremendous strain on the body...!</font>

288
00:19:27,850 --> 00:19:29,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee, let this be the finishing blow!</font>

289
00:19:43,450 --> 00:19:45,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this!</font>

290
00:19:47,370 --> 00:19:49,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Primary Lotus!</font>

291
00:20:16,360 --> 00:20:17,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got him...</font>

292
00:20:18,190 --> 00:20:18,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">good!</font>

293
00:20:20,780 --> 00:20:22,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right on!</font>

294
00:20:22,650 --> 00:20:24,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-It's over!</font>

295
00:20:24,570 --> 00:20:26,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What? This can't be!</font>

296
00:20:26,780 --> 00:20:29,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He did it! Lee-san's won!</font>

297
00:20:30,160 --> 00:20:32,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, he isn't dead, is he?</font>

298
